text: ["({B/P} can be paid with either {B} or 2 life.)\\nChoose target card in a graveyard other than a basic land card. Search its owner's graveyard, hand, and library for any number of cards with the same name as that card and exile them. Then that player shuffles.", "({G/W} can be paid with either {G} or {W}.)\\nOther permanents you control have hexproof. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'A deck can have any number of cards named Shadowborn Apostle.\\n{B}, Sacrifice six creatures named Shadowborn Apostle: Search your library for a Demon creature card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'All creatures have haste.', 'Anger of the Gods deals 3 damage to each creature. If a creature dealt damage this way would die this turn, exile it instead.', "As Cavern of Souls enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a creature spell of the chosen type, and that spell can't be countered.", "As Pithing Needle enters the battlefield, choose a card name.\\nActivated abilities of sources with the chosen name can't be activated unless they're mana abilities.", 'As The Mimeoplasm enters the battlefield, you may exile two creature cards from graveyards. If you do, it enters the battlefield as a copy of one of those cards with a number of additional +1/+1 counters on it equal to the power of the other card.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.\\nDraw two cards and create two Treasure tokens. (They\'re artifacts with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, exile a creature card from your graveyard.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nYou gain life equal to the sacrificed creature's toughness. Destroy target creature an opponent controls.", 'As long as Necrotic Ooze is on the battlefield, it has all activated abilities of all creature cards in all graveyards.', 'As you create your deck, circle two of the colors below.\\nCryptic Spires enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add one mana of either of the circled colors.', 'At the beginning of your end step, you may pay {2}{R} and sacrifice a nonland permanent. If you do, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a nonland permanent card. Put that card onto the battlefield and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'At the beginning of your precombat main phase, remove all flood counters from Bounty of the Luxa. If no counters were removed this way, put a flood counter on Bounty of the Luxa and draw a card. Otherwise, add {C}{G}{U}.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control if you control a creature with power 5 or greater. Then you gain 10 life if you control a creature with power 10 or greater. Then you win the game if you control a creature with power 20 or greater.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put a time counter on As Foretold.\\nOnce each turn, you may pay {0} rather than pay the mana cost for a spell you cast with mana value X or less, where X is the number of time counters on As Foretold.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 1 life and create a 1/1 black Faerie Rogue creature token with flying.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may put a charge counter on Aether Vial.\\n{T}: You may put a creature card with mana value equal to the number of charge counters on Aether Vial from your hand onto the battlefield.', "Azorius Chancery enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Azorius Chancery enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {W}{U}.", "Bestow {6}{R} (If you cast this card for its bestow cost, it's an Aura spell with enchant creature. It becomes a creature again if it's not attached to a creature.)\\nMenace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has menace.", 'Bolster 1, then put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it. (To bolster 1, choose a creature with the least toughness among creatures you control and put a +1/+1 counter on it.)', "Boros Garrison enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Boros Garrison enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{W}.", 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nReach\\nWhen Webweaver Changeling enters the battlefield, if there are three or more creature cards in your graveyard, you gain 5 life.', "Choose one or both —\\n• Exile target creature you don't control.\\n• Exile target creature you control, then return it to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'Choose one —\\n• Counter target noncreature spell unless its controller pays {2}.\\n• Izzet Charm deals 2 damage to target creature.\\n• Draw two cards, then discard two cards.', "Choose one —\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Put target creature on the bottom of its owner's library.\\n• Counter target instant spell.", 'Choose one —\\n• Exile target creature with power 3 or greater.\\n• You draw two cards and you lose 2 life.\\n• Distribute two +1/+1 counters among one or two target creatures.', "Choose one —\\n• Put target creature on top of its owner's library.\\n• Jeskai Charm deals 4 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.\\n• Creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain lifelink until end of turn.", "Choose two —\\n• Prevent all damage target instant or sorcery spell would deal this turn.\\n• Target player sacrifices an enchantment.\\n• Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\n• Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control.", "Choose two —\\n• Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n• Target player discards a card.\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Kolaghan's Command deals 2 damage to any target.", "Choose two —\\n• Your opponents can't gain life this turn.\\n• Atarka's Command deals 3 damage to each opponent.\\n• You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.\\n• Creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain reach until end of turn.", 'Coldsteel Heart enters the battlefield tapped.\\nAs Coldsteel Heart enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\n{T}: Add one mana of the chosen color.', 'Converge — Search your library for a creature, instant, or sorcery card with mana value less than or equal to the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell, exile that card, then shuffle. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost.', "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nIndestructible", 'Counter target noncreature spell unless its controller pays {2}.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', "Counter target spell. At the beginning of your next main phase, add an amount of {C} equal to that spell's mana value.", 'Crackling Doom deals 2 damage to each opponent. Each opponent sacrifices a creature with the greatest power among creatures that player controls.', 'Create a 1/2 green Spider creature token with reach for each creature card in your graveyard.\\nFlashback {6}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create three 1/1 white Vampire creature tokens with lifelink.', 'Create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens. Until end of turn, creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain haste. (They can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\nWhenever Graveblade Marauder deals combat damage to a player, that player loses life equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.', 'Defender\\nWhen Wall of Omens enters the battlefield, draw a card.', "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target non-Elf creature.', 'Destroy target nonartifact creature.', 'Destroy target permanent an opponent controls. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Dethrone (Whenever this creature attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\nOther creatures you control have dethrone.\\nWhenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it dies, return that card to the battlefield under your control at the beginning of the next end step.', "Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {U}{B}.", 'Distribute three +1/+1 counters among one, two, or three target creatures, then double the number of +1/+1 counters on each of those creatures.', 'Draw X cards, then discard a card.', 'Draw four cards, then choose X cards in your hand and discard the rest.', 'During each of your turns, you may play a land and cast a permanent spell of each permanent type from your graveyard. (If a card has multiple permanent types, choose one as you play it.)', 'Each creature assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power.', 'Each creature card in your graveyard has unearth {2}{B}. ({2}{B}: Return the card to the battlefield. The creature gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', "Each other creature you control enters the battlefield with a number of additional +1/+1 counters on it equal to Master Biomancer's power and as a Mutant in addition to its other types.", 'Each player mills two cards. Then you put a creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.\\nAt the beginning of the end step, if enchanted creature's power is 4 or greater, destroy Arachnus Web.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has first strike.\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature loses all abilities and has base power and toughness 1/1.', "Enchant creature\\nWhen Knightly Valor enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 white Knight creature token with vigilance. (Attacking doesn't cause it to tap.)\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has vigilance.", 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Strands of Undeath enters the battlefield, target player discards two cards.\\n{B}: Regenerate enchanted creature.', "Enchant creature\\nYou control enchanted creature.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if enchanted creature's power is 4 or greater, sacrifice Domestication.", 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 for each of its colors.\\nEquip {1}', "Equipped creature gets +1/+1 for each color among permanents you control.\\nAs long as Conqueror's Flail is attached to a creature, your opponents can't cast spells during your turn.\\nEquip {2}", 'Equipped creature gets +2/+0 and has "Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell, this creature deals 2 damage to any target."\\nEquip {2}', "Equipped creature gets +2/+0.\\nWhenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, create a token that's a copy of Bloodforged Battle-Axe.\\nEquip {2}", "Equipped creature gets +2/+2, has intimidate, and is a black Zombie. (A creature with intimidate can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)\\nWhenever a nontoken creature is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, you may pay {4}. If you do, return that card to the battlefield and attach Nim Deathmantle to it.\\nEquip {4}", 'Evolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\\nRemove two +1/+1 counters from Experiment One: Regenerate Experiment One. (The next time this creature would be destroyed, instead tap it, remove it from combat, and heal all damage on it.)', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever a creature you control attacks alone, it gains double strike until end of turn.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\n{1}, Sacrifice Qasali Pridemage: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Exile a creature you control: Add X mana of any one color, where X is 1 plus the exiled creature's mana value. Spend this mana only to cast creature spells.", 'Exile target creature with power 2 or less. Its controller gains 4 life.', "Exile target creature you control, then return it to the battlefield under its owner's control.\\nFlashback {3}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)", 'Exile target creature. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Exile target nonland permanent. You lose 3 life.', 'Fiery Fall deals 5 damage to target creature.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Fiery Justice deals 5 damage divided as you choose among any number of targets. Target opponent gains 5 life.', 'Firemind Vessel enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add two mana of different colors.', "First strike, deathtouch\\nMaster of Cruelties can only attack alone.\\nWhenever Master of Cruelties attacks a player and isn't blocked, that player's life total becomes 1. Master of Cruelties assigns no combat damage this combat.", 'First strike\\nWhenever Alesha, Who Smiles at Death attacks, you may pay {W/B}{W/B}. If you do, return target creature card with power 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped and attacking.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nEnchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1.\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', "Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nEnchant creature\\nWhen Capture Sphere enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nFlying\\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Flash\\nFlying\\nWhen Restoration Angel enters the battlefield, you may exile target non-Angel creature you control, then return that card to the battlefield under your control.', 'Flash\\nOther white creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther blue creatures you control get +1/+1.', "Flash\\nWhen Venser, Shaper Savant enters the battlefield, return target spell or permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Flying', 'Flying, deathtouch\\nWhen Dragonlord Silumgar enters the battlefield, gain control of target creature or planeswalker for as long as you control Dragonlord Silumgar.', 'Flying, double strike, lifelink\\nWhenever you gain life, draw a card.', 'Flying, trample, haste\\n{R}: Hellkite Overlord gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\n{B}{G}: Regenerate Hellkite Overlord.', "Flying, trample\\nWhenever Wasitora, Nekoru Queen deals combat damage to a player, that player sacrifices a creature. If the player can't, you create a 3/3 black, red, and green Cat Dragon creature token with flying.", 'Flying, trample\\nWhenever an opponent searches their library, that player sacrifices a creature and loses 10 life.\\nWhenever another creature dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Ob Nixilis, Unshackled.', 'Flying, vigilance, haste\\nWhenever Aurelia, the Warleader attacks for the first time each turn, untap all creatures you control. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase.', "Flying, vigilance\\n{T}: Choose a creature card at random from target opponent's graveyard. Put that card onto the battlefield under your control.", "Flying\\nDiscard a card: Oona's Prowler gets -2/-0 until end of turn. Any player may activate this ability.", "Flying\\nEmbalm {6}{U} ({6}{U}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a white Zombie Bird Warrior with no mana cost. Embalm only as a sorcery.)", 'Flying\\nHeroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Wingsteed Rider, put a +1/+1 counter on Wingsteed Rider.', 'Flying\\nOther blue creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther black creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Flying\\nProwess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhen Bloodwater Entity enters the battlefield, you may put target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard on top of your library.', "Flying\\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nAll damage that would be dealt to you is dealt to Empyrial Archangel instead.", 'Flying\\nWhen Ashen Rider enters the battlefield or dies, exile target permanent.', 'Flying\\nWhen Balustrade Spy enters the battlefield, target player reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a land card, then puts those cards into their graveyard.', "Flying\\nWhen Flickerwisp enters the battlefield, exile another target permanent. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", "Flying\\nWhen Lyev Skyknight enters the battlefield, detain target nonland permanent an opponent controls. (Until your next turn, that permanent can't attack or block and its activated abilities can't be activated.)", "Flying\\nWhen Magister Sphinx enters the battlefield, target player's life total becomes 10.", "Flying\\nWhen Mulldrifter enters the battlefield, draw two cards.\\nEvoke {2}{U} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", 'Flying\\nWhen Psychic Symbiont enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card and you draw a card.', "Flying\\nWhen Reveillark leaves the battlefield, return up to two target creature cards with power 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nEvoke {5}{W} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", 'Flying\\nWhen Vampire Sovereign enters the battlefield, target opponent loses 3 life and you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Backdraft Hellkite attacks, each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard gains flashback until end of turn. The flashback cost is equal to its mana cost.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Intet, the Dreamer deals combat damage to a player, you may pay {2}{U}. If you do, exile the top card of your library face down. You may look at that card for as long as it remains exiled. You may play that card without paying its mana cost for as long as Intet remains on the battlefield.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Kaalia of the Vast attacks an opponent, you may put an Angel, Demon, or Dragon creature card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped and attacking that opponent.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Sedraxis Specter deals combat damage to a player, that player discards a card.\\nUnearth {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever Teneb, the Harvester deals combat damage to a player, you may pay {2}{B}. If you do, put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Zur the Enchanter attacks, you may search your library for an enchantment card with mana value 3 or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature attacks, you may pay {3}. When you do, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature.', 'Flying\\nWhenever an opponent draws a card, you may draw two cards.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast a spell, put the cards in your hand on the bottom of your library in any order, then draw that many cards.', 'Flying\\nYou may pay {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than pay the mana cost for spells that you cast.', 'Flying\\n{2}{U}, Discard two cards: Return Advanced Stitchwing from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', 'Flying\\n{3}{G}{U}: You gain 2 life and draw a card.', 'Ghave, Guru of Spores enters the battlefield with five +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from a creature you control: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\\n{1}, Sacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "Golgari Rot Farm enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Golgari Rot Farm enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {B}{G}.", "Gravecrawler can't block.\\nYou may cast Gravecrawler from your graveyard as long as you control a Zombie.", 'Ground Assault deals damage to target creature equal to the number of lands you control.', "Gruul Turf enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Gruul Turf enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{G}.", 'Haste\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice a creature. When you do, Fireblade Artist deals 2 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.', 'Haste\\nCascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.)', 'Haste\\nProwess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', "Haste\\nScavenge {3}{B}{G} ({3}{B}{G}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Put a number of +1/+1 counters equal to this card's power on target creature. Scavenge only as a sorcery.)", "Haste\\nWhenever Skullbriar, the Walking Grave deals combat damage to a player, put a +1/+1 counter on it.\\nCounters remain on Skullbriar as it moves to any zone other than a player's hand or library.", 'Haste\\nWhenever Thraximundar attacks, defending player sacrifices a creature.\\nWhenever a player sacrifices a creature, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Thraximundar.', 'Haste\\nWhenever a creature an opponent controls dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Yahenni, Undying Partisan.\\nSacrifice another creature: Yahenni gains indestructible until end of turn.', 'Haste\\nWhenever you cast a spell that targets Tenth District Legionnaire, put a +1/+1 counter on Tenth District Legionnaire, then scry 1.', "Haunt (When this creature dies, exile it haunting target creature.)\\nWhen Orzhov Pontiff enters the battlefield or the creature it haunts dies, choose one —\\n• Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.\\n• Creatures you don't control get -1/-1 until end of turn.", 'Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Centaur Battlemaster, put three +1/+1 counters on Centaur Battlemaster.', 'Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Labyrinth Champion, Labyrinth Champion deals 2 damage to any target.', "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nUril, the Miststalker gets +2/+2 for each Aura attached to it.", 'If an artifact or creature entering the battlefield causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time.', "If it's not your turn, you may exile a blue card from your hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nCounter target noncreature spell. If that spell is countered this way, exile it instead of putting it into its owner's graveyard.", 'If one or more +1/+1 counters would be put on a creature you control, that many plus one +1/+1 counters are put on it instead.', 'If one or more +1/+1 counters would be put on a creature you control, that many plus one +1/+1 counters are put on that creature instead.\\nWhen Conclave Mentor dies, you gain life equal to its power.', 'If one or more creature tokens would be created under your control, that many 4/4 white Angel creature tokens with flying and vigilance are created instead.', 'Indestructible\\nEquipped creature has indestructible.\\nEquip {2}', "Izzet Boilerworks enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Izzet Boilerworks enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {U}{R}.", 'Lava Coil deals 4 damage to target creature. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', "Lavalanche deals X damage to target player or planeswalker and each creature that player or that planeswalker's controller controls.", "Lifelink\\nWhenever another creature dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Elenda, the Dusk Rose.\\nWhen Elenda dies, create X 1/1 white Vampire creature tokens with lifelink, where X is Elenda's power.", 'Lightning Bolt deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Lightning Helix deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.', "Liliana's Elite gets +1/+1 for each creature card in your graveyard.", 'Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.\\nFlashback {6}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Lord of Extinction's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in all graveyards.", "Mana Vault doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may pay {4}. If you do, untap Mana Vault.\\nAt the beginning of your draw step, if Mana Vault is tapped, it deals 1 damage to you.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.", 'Menace\\nAt the beginning of your end step, put a bounty counter on target creature an opponent controls. For as long as that creature has a bounty counter on it, it has "When this creature dies, each opponent draws a card and gains 2 life."', 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\\n{1}{R}: Goblin Banneret gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Mikaeus, the Lunarch enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Mikaeus.\\n{T}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Mikaeus: Put a +1/+1 counter on each other creature you control.', 'Mill three cards, then you may return a creature or land card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Orzhov Basilica enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Orzhov Basilica enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {W}{B}.", 'Other black creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther green creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may create a 1/1 black and green Worm creature token.', 'Other black creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther red creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever Ashenmoor Liege becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, that player loses 4 life.', 'Other blue creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther red creatures you control get +1/+1.\\n{U/R}{U/R}{U/R}{U/R}: You may put a blue or red creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.', 'Other creatures you control get +1/+0.\\nWhenever a nontoken creature you control dies, Judith, the Scourge Diva deals 1 damage to any target.', "Other green creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther blue creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nUntap all green and/or blue creatures you control during each other player's untap step.", 'Other green creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther white creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nIf a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Wilt-Leaf Liege, put it onto the battlefield instead of putting it into your graveyard.', 'Other red creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther white creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever you cast a red spell, Balefire Liege deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\nWhenever you cast a white spell, you gain 3 life.', "Other white creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther black creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever you cast a white spell, you may tap target creature.\\nWhenever you cast a black spell, you may destroy target creature if it's tapped.", 'Outlast {1}{W} ({1}{W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Outlast only as a sorcery.)\\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has first strike.', 'Outlast {G} ({G}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Outlast only as a sorcery.)\\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has trample.', 'Outlast {W} ({W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Outlast only as a sorcery.)\\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has flying.', "Players can't search libraries. Any player may pay {2} for that player to ignore this effect until end of turn.", 'Prophetic Bolt deals 4 damage to any target. Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of those cards into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Protection from white and from black\\nWhenever you cast a creature spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Animar, Soul of Elements.\\nCreature spells you cast cost {1} less to cast for each +1/+1 counter on Animar.', 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhen Abbot of Keral Keep enters the battlefield, exile the top card of your library. Until end of turn, you may play that card.', 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever Jeskai Elder deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card.', 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, Seeker of the Way gains lifelink until end of turn.', 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, create a 1/1 white Monk creature token with prowess.', 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, target creature gains flying until end of turn.', 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nYou may look at the top card of your library any time.\\nYou may cast noncreature spells from the top of your library. If you cast a spell this way, you may cast it as though it had flash.', 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\n{U}: Ingenious Skaab gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on each of X target creatures.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.\\nFlashback {1}{W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. That creature gains first strike until end of turn. You gain 2 life.', 'Raid — When Storm Fleet Pyromancer enters the battlefield, if you attacked this turn, Storm Fleet Pyromancer deals 2 damage to any target.', "Rakdos Carnarium enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Rakdos Carnarium enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {B}{R}.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Reach, trample\\nCascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.)', 'Reach\\nTap an untapped Spider you control: Search your graveyard and/or library for a card named Arachnus Web and put it onto the battlefield attached to target creature. If you search your library this way, shuffle.', "Red creatures you control get +1/+0.\\nWhite creatures you control get +0/+1.\\n{R}{W}, Exile Legion's Initiative: Exile all creatures you control. At the beginning of the next combat, return those cards to the battlefield under their owner's control and those creatures gain haste until end of turn.", 'Red instant and sorcery spells you control have lifelink.\\nWhenever a white instant or sorcery spell causes you to gain life, Firesong and Sunspeaker deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', "Return all permanents of the color of your choice to their owners' hands.", 'Return an instant card at random from your graveyard to your hand.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nFlashback {3}{W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Reveal the cards in your library. An opponent chooses from among them a creature card, a land card, and a noncreature, nonland card. You put the chosen cards into your hand. Then shuffle.', 'Reveal the top four cards of your library. You may put a creature card from among them onto the battlefield. It gains "At the beginning of your end step, return this creature to its owner\'s hand." Then put the rest of the cards revealed this way on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Rift Bolt deals 3 damage to any target.\\nSuspend 1—{R} (Rather than cast this card from your hand, you may pay {R} and exile it with a time counter on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a time counter. When the last is removed, you may cast it without paying its mana cost.)', 'Sacrifice Dauntless Escort: Creatures you control gain indestructible until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Add one mana of any color.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Bloodflow Connoisseur.', 'Sacrifice another creature: Cartel Aristocrat gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a card, then shuffle and put that card on top. You lose 2 life.', "Search your library for a green creature card with mana value X or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle. Shuffle Green Sun's Zenith into its owner's library.", 'Search your library for up to four cards with different names and reveal them. Target opponent chooses two of those cards. Put the chosen cards into your graveyard and the rest into your hand. Then shuffle.', "Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{W}.", "Simic Growth Chamber enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Simic Growth Chamber enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{U}.", "Sparkmage's Gambit deals 1 damage to each of up to two target creatures. Those creatures can't block this turn.", 'Spells you cast have ripple 4. (Whenever you cast a spell, you may reveal the top four cards of your library. You may cast spells with the same name as that spell from among the revealed cards without paying their mana costs. Put the rest on the bottom of your library.)', 'Staggershock deals 2 damage to any target.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', "Strive — This spell costs {2}{R} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nChoose any number of target creatures you control. For each of them, create a token that's a copy of that creature, except it has haste. Exile those tokens at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Suspend 10—{R}\\nSacrifice an artifact, creature, or land: Remove a time counter from Greater Gargadon. Activate only if Greater Gargadon is suspended.', "Take an extra turn after this one. At the beginning of that turn's end step, you lose the game.", 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. If you cast this spell during your main phase, that creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn instead.', 'Target creature gets +3/+0 until end of turn.\\nTarget creature gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+1 until end of turn. Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'Target creature gets +4/-4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-0 until end of turn.\\nTarget creature gets -0/-3 until end of turn.', "Target creature you control gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn. (It can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, enchanted, or equipped by anything of that color.)\\nScry 1.", 'Target creature you control gets +1/+0 until end of turn. It deals damage equal to its power to target creature an opponent controls.', 'Target opponent exiles the top X cards of their library. You may cast any number of spells with mana value X or less from among them without paying their mana costs.', 'Target player draws two cards.\\nFlashback—{1}{U}, Pay 3 life. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Target player mills ten cards.', 'Target player mills two cards.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target player reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it with mana value 3 or less. That player discards that card.', "The owner of target permanent shuffles it into their library, then reveals the top card of their library. If it's a permanent card, they put it onto the battlefield.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nDestroy all creatures.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nFlying, lifelink\\nYour opponents can't cast spells during your turn.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nGreen spells you control can't be countered.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Until end of turn, each Elf creature you control has base power and toughness 5/5 and becomes a Dinosaur in addition to its other creature types.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nWhen you cast this spell, take an extra turn after this one.\\nFlying, protection from spells that are one or more colors, annihilator 6\\nWhen Emrakul, the Aeons Torn is put into a graveyard from anywhere, its owner shuffles their graveyard into their library.", 'This spell costs {1} less to cast for each creature card in your graveyard.\\nOnce during each of your turns, you may cast a creature spell from your graveyard.', 'This spell costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.\\nProwess\\nWhen Bedlam Reveler enters the battlefield, discard your hand, then draw three cards.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nWhenever you cast a spell that targets Gnarlback Rhino, draw a card.", 'Trample\\nDiscard a creature card: Put a +1/+1 counter on Lotleth Troll.\\n{B}: Regenerate Lotleth Troll.', 'Trample\\nOther red creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther green creatures you control get +1/+1.', "Trample\\nSplinterfright's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, mill two cards.", "Trample\\nWhen Child of Alara dies, destroy all nonland permanents. They can't be regenerated.", 'Trample\\nWhenever Grim Flayer deals combat damage to a player, surveil 3. (Look at the top three cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)\\nDelirium — Grim Flayer gets +2/+2 as long as there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard.', "Trample\\nWhenever Scion of Darkness deals combat damage to a player, you may put target creature card from that player's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.\\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Ulasht, the Hate Seed enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each other red creature you control and a +1/+1 counter on it for each other green creature you control.\\n{1}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Ulasht: Choose one —\\n• Ulasht deals 1 damage to target creature.\\n• Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'Until end of turn, target creature gets +2/+0 and gains "When this creature dies, return it to the battlefield tapped under its owner\'s control."', "Until your next turn, your life total can't change and you gain protection from everything. All permanents you control phase out. (While they're phased out, they're treated as though they don't exist. They phase in before you untap during your untap step.)\\nExile Teferi's Protection.", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\\nWhen Militia Bugler enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card with power 2 or less from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.", 'Vigilance, reach\\nRuric Thar, the Unbowed attacks each combat if able.\\nWhenever a player casts a noncreature spell, Ruric Thar deals 6 damage to that player.', "Vigilance, trample\\n{2}, {T}: Exile another target creature. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", 'When Abzan Ascendancy enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.\\nWhenever a nontoken creature you control dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', "When Aethersnipe enters the battlefield, return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand.\\nEvoke {1}{U}{U} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", "When Bear's Companion enters the battlefield, create a 4/4 green Bear creature token.", 'When Brindle Shoat dies, create a 3/3 green Boar creature token.', 'When Burning-Tree Emissary enters the battlefield, add {R}{G}.', 'When Carrier Thrall dies, create a 1/1 colorless Eldrazi Scion creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'When Chronicler of Heroes enters the battlefield, draw a card if you control a creature with a +1/+1 counter on it.', "When Coiling Oracle enters the battlefield, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a land card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put that card into your hand.", 'When Dockside Extortionist enters the battlefield, create X Treasure tokens, where X is the number of artifacts and enchantments your opponents control. (Treasure tokens are artifacts with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', 'When Doomed Traveler dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'When Elvish Rejuvenator enters the battlefield, look at the top five cards of your library. You may put a land card from among them onto the battlefield tapped. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'When Eternal Witness enters the battlefield, you may return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Glowspore Shaman enters the battlefield, mill three cards. You may put a land card from your graveyard on top of your library. (To mill a card, put the top card of your library into your graveyard.)', 'When Hostage Taker enters the battlefield, exile another target creature or artifact until Hostage Taker leaves the battlefield. You may cast that card for as long as it remains exiled, and mana of any type can be spent to cast that spell.', "When Kederekt Leviathan enters the battlefield, return all other nonland permanents to their owners' hands.\\nUnearth {6}{U} ({6}{U}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)", 'When Living Lightning dies, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Relief Captain enters the battlefield, support 3. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to three other target creatures.)', 'When Rishkar, Peema Renegade enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.\\nEach creature you control with a counter on it has "{T}: Add {G}."', 'When Scab-Clan Giant enters the battlefield, it fights target creature an opponent controls chosen at random.', 'When Seasoned Pyromancer enters the battlefield, discard two cards, then draw two cards. For each nonland card discarded this way, create a 1/1 red Elemental creature token.\\n{3}{R}{R}, Exile Seasoned Pyromancer from your graveyard: Create two 1/1 red Elemental creature tokens.', "When Seekers' Squire enters the battlefield, it explores. (Reveal the top card of your library. Put that card into your hand if it's a land. Otherwise, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature, then put the card back or put it into your graveyard.)", 'When Sensor Splicer enters the battlefield, create a 3/3 colorless Phyrexian Golem artifact creature token.\\nGolem creatures you control have vigilance.', 'When Skeleton Archer enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to any target.', 'When Skinrender enters the battlefield, put three -1/-1 counters on target creature.', 'When Sprouting Thrinax dies, create three 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.', 'When Sultai Soothsayer enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', 'When you cast this spell, destroy target permanent.\\nIndestructible\\nAnnihilator 4 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices four permanents.)\\nWhen Ulamog, the Infinite Gyre is put into a graveyard from anywhere, its owner shuffles their graveyard into their library.', 'When you cast this spell, draw four cards.\\nAnnihilator 4 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices four permanents.)\\nWhen Kozilek, Butcher of Truth is put into a graveyard from anywhere, its owner shuffles their graveyard into their library.', 'When you cast this spell, you gain half X life and draw half X cards. Round down each time.\\nFlying, trample\\nHydroid Krasis enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.', 'Whenever Blood Artist or another creature dies, target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever City of Brass becomes tapped, it deals 1 damage to you.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Whenever Sidisi, Brood Tyrant enters the battlefield or attacks, mill three cards.\\nWhenever one or more creature cards are put into your graveyard from your library, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, if it entered from your graveyard or you cast it from your graveyard, return Prized Amalgam from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Whenever a creature with power 2 or less enters the battlefield under your control, you get an experience counter.\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, put X +1/+1 counters on another target creature you control, where X is the number of experience counters you have.', 'Whenever a player draws a card, that player loses 2 life unless they pay {2}.', 'Whenever an opponent casts a noncreature spell, that player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', "Whenever an opponent casts a spell, Kaervek the Merciless deals damage equal to that spell's mana value to any target.", 'Whenever an opponent draws a card, that player may pay {2}. If the player doesn\'t, you create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', 'Whenever another creature dies, you may have Hissing Iguanar deal 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, Kruin Striker gets +1/+0 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Whenever another creature with power 2 or less enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {1}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Whenever you attack with one or more Zombies, draw that many cards, then discard that many cards. You gain that much life.\\n{2}, Exile two cards from your graveyard: Create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Whenever you cast a multicolored spell, Gloryscale Viashino gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn. Untap those creatures.\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, put a lore counter on Myth Realized.\\n{2}{W}: Put a lore counter on Myth Realized.\\n{W}: Until end of turn, Myth Realized becomes a Monk Avatar creature in addition to its other types and gains "This creature\'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of lore counters on it."', 'Whenever you cast a spell that targets Hero of the Games, creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell with mana value greater than the number of experience counters you have, you get an experience counter.\\nInstant and sorcery spells you cast cost {1} less to cast for each experience counter you have.', "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, copy it for each other instant and sorcery spell you've cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.", 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 1/1 red Elemental creature token.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 2/2 blue Drake creature token with flying.', 'White spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nBlue spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nSpells your opponents cast cost {1} more to cast.', 'You may cast spells as though they had flash.', 'You may have Body Double enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature card in a graveyard.', "You may have Dack's Duplicate enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield, except it has haste and dethrone. (Whenever it attacks the player with the most life or tied for most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'You may play an additional land on each of your turns.\\nPlay with the top card of your library revealed.\\nYou may play lands from the top of your library.', 'You may play lands from your graveyard.', 'You may play up to three additional lands this turn.', '[+1]: Draw a card, then put a card from your hand on top of your library.\\n[−1]: Exile another target permanent you own, then return it to the battlefield under your control.\\n[−6]: Choose left or right. Each player gains control of all nonland permanents other than Aminatou, the Fateshifter controlled by the next player in the chosen direction.\\nAminatou, the Fateshifter can be your commander.', '[+1]: Return up to one target land card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n[−1]: Wrenn and Six deals 1 damage to any target.\\n[−7]: You get an emblem with "Instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard have retrace." (You may cast instant and sorcery cards from your graveyard by discarding a land card in addition to paying their other costs.)', '[+1]: Up to one target creature gets -2/-1 until your next turn.\\n[−2]: Mill two cards, then you may return a creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n[−7]: You get an emblem with "At the beginning of your end step, create X 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens, where X is two plus the number of Zombies you control."', '[+2]: Target opponent exiles cards from the top of their library until they exile a nonland card. Until end of turn, you may cast that card without paying its mana cost.\\n[+1]: Each opponent exiles two cards from their hand.\\n[−4]: Nicol Bolas, God-Pharaoh deals 7 damage to target opponent, creature an opponent controls, or planeswalker an opponent controls.\\n[−12]: Exile each nonland permanent your opponents control.', '{1}, Exile an instant or sorcery card from your graveyard: Choose one —\\n• Counter target noncreature spell unless its controller pays {2}.\\n• Disciple of the Ring gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\n• Tap target creature.\\n• Untap target creature.', "{1}, Sacrifice Traveler's Amulet: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", '{1}, Sacrifice a creature: Exile the top card of your library. You may play that card this turn. (You still pay its costs. You can play a land this way only if you have an available land play remaining.)', '{1}, Sacrifice another creature: Blazing Hellhound deals 1 damage to any target.', "{1}: Look at the top three cards of your library, then put them back in any order.\\n{T}: Draw a card, then put Sensei's Divining Top on top of its owner's library.", '{1}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', '{2}, {T}: Create a 0/1 green Egg creature token with defender.\\nWhenever an Egg you control dies, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a creature card. Put that card onto the battlefield and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', '{2}, {T}: You may put a multicolored creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.', '{2}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Each other player sacrifices a creature.\\n{2}{R}, Sacrifice an artifact: Each other player sacrifices an artifact.\\n{2}{G}, Sacrifice an enchantment: Each other player sacrifices an enchantment.', "{2}{W}{U}: Exile target creature. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", "{3}: Exile another target creature you control, then return it to the battlefield under its owner's control.\\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {G/W}. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on it. If it's a Unicorn, put two +1/+1 counters on it instead. ({G/W} can be paid with either {G} or {W}.)", '{3}{U}, {T}: Draw a card.\\n{X}{R}, {T}: Copy target instant or sorcery spell you control with mana value X. You may choose new targets for the copy.', '{3}{U}, {T}: Exile another target creature you control, then return that card to the battlefield under your control.', '{8}, {T}: Search your library for a permanent card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{R/W}: Figure of Destiny becomes a Kithkin Spirit with base power and toughness 2/2.\\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}: If Figure of Destiny is a Spirit, it becomes a Kithkin Spirit Warrior with base power and toughness 4/4.\\n{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}{R/W}: If Figure of Destiny is a Warrior, it becomes a Kithkin Spirit Warrior Avatar with base power and toughness 8/8, flying, and first strike.', '{T}, Mill a card: Add {C}. (To mill a card, put the top card of your library into your graveyard.)', '{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a multicolored spell.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\nWhenever you tap Forbidden Orchard for mana, target opponent creates a 1/1 colorless Spirit creature token.', '{T}: Add {G}.\\nPut a -1/-1 counter on Devoted Druid: Untap Devoted Druid.', '{T}: For each color among permanents you control, add one mana of that color.', '{W}, {T}: Search your library for a land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle. Activate only if an opponent controls more lands than you.']
flavor: ['". . . some sort of giant lizard-bat thing. Yeah, we shot it. No, nothing to clean up."\\n—Archelle, chief exterminator', '"A herd is only as strong as its weakest. Our weakest just killed his third minotaur raider—today."\\n—Braulios of Pheres Band', '"A touch of lightning, and anyone can be taught to dance."\\n—Tobin, sparkmage', '"Aether is the soul of Kaladesh, and all souls should be free."', '"After death you face paradise, damnation, or Tariel."\\n—Priest\'s teaching', '"All are not equal—neither in life nor after death. Bontu\'s favorites will stand highest in eternity."\\n—Senifet, vizier of Bontu', '"All the treasures of this world are grown, not made."', '"All will know of your crimes."', '"Brave scar or unfortunate tale? It all depends on your pain threshold."', '"Chronicles across the ages describe Jodah. They likely refer not to one mage, but to a family or an arcane title."\\n—Arkol, Argivian scholar', '"Commander, we caught the Dimir spy and took her ashes into custody."\\n—Kramm, Wojek security officer', '"Death not for survival but for vanity and pleasure? This is the decadence I sought to curb."\\n—Sorin Markov', '"Death tried to uncrown me. But now I return, king of a greater realm."', '"Each year that passes rings you inwardly with memory and might. Wield your heart, and the world will tremble."', '"Esper, like any work of art, can be truly appreciated only from a distance."\\n—Tezzeret', '"Finally, a weapon the Boros can\'t confiscate!"\\n—Juri, proprietor of the Juri Revue', '"From dust and light She coaxed forth an uncorrupted world. By Her grace we dwell here, free from suffering."\\n—*Song of All*, canto 11', '"Garl, adjust the slurry dispensers. Garl, fetch more corpses. Garl, quit crying and give me your brain tissue. If he doesn\'t stop being so rude, I\'m quitting."', '"Greet death with sword in hand."', '"He is Yawgmoth\'s reward to me. I shall kill him a hundred times a day."\\n—Crovax, to Ertai', '"Hold the line, for family and the fallen!"', '"Hop away now, little Eternal. Go eat some flies."\\n—Kasmina', '"I am confident that if anyone actually penetrates our facades, even the most perceptive would still be fundamentally unprepared for the truth of House Dimir."\\n—Szadek', '"I am who I pretend to be."', '"I await your donation."\\n—Dasha, Orzhov priest', '"I do things in my own time."\\n—Etha, initiate of Rhet crop', '"I don\'t know where my destiny lies, but I know it isn\'t here."', '"I have faith in your potential."', '"I search for a vision of Zendikar that does not include the Eldrazi."\\n—Expedition journal entry', '"I suppose you\'ve never heard of conservation of energy."', '"I swear this before all gods old and new: I will fight to my last breath."', '"I think it\'s trying to tell us that the forest is angry."\\n—Vivien Reid', '"I turn around and see nothing, yet I know it is behind me. Its fingers rummage in my mind, crafting new ideas."', '"I\'ll grant that the siege engines are gone, but do you think that might have been a bit of overkill?"\\n—Sergeant Malsworth', '"I\'ll have my revenge if I have to call on every force from above and below."', '"I\'ve seen Ravnica\'s fate. Believe me, I\'m doing you a favor."', '"If there can be no victory, then I will fight forever."\\n—Koth of the Hammer', '"If you make me spill my drink, you\'re buying me a new one."', '"Improvement is a consequence of practice."\\n—Stitcher Geralf', '"In these halls there is no pass or fail. Your true test comes with the first full moon."', '"Innistrad\'s ghoulcallers are talented enough, but let me show you what someone with real power can create."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"It always amazes me what perfectly good things people throw away."\\n—Ludevic, necro-alchemist', '"It is finished. Now the real work can begin."\\n—Tezzeret', '"It used to be a lair. Now it\'s just a tunnel."', '"It\'s a cruel thing to give such a sad song to such a colorful creature."\\n—Sana, former Ahn-crop initiate', '"It\'s just business."', '"It\'s not the darkness I fear but dull and numbing shades of gray."\\n—Sydri, galvanic genius', '"Krosa the great. Krosa the enduring. Look to the forest, and it will share its bounty."\\n—Zyd, Kamahlite druid', '"Later we will mourn those we have lost. First we must end their suffering."\\n—Drana, Kalastria bloodchief', '"Let\'s find out what kind of audience you are. Festive? Fearless?"', '"Ludevic\'s laboratory is a veritable wonderland. I have never felt so inspired."\\n—Stitcher Geralf', '"Mana lurks in all things, even in the depths of one\'s own heart."', '"My child grew from rot and ruin, yet she bloomed."\\n—Multani', '"My drivers are trustworthy. I removed their tongues myself. Any other questions?"', '"My observations of the Multiverse are too valuable not to preserve for posterity."\\n—Dovin Baan', '"My, how shocking."\\n—Barrin, Tolarian archmage', '"Naga shed their scales. We wear ours with pride."\\n—Golran, dragonscale captain', '"Nature is a wonderful engineer but works far too slowly for my tastes."', '"No sign of movement. Looks like we\'ve got the element of sur—"\\n—Gaiza, Mardu raider', '"Oh, for heaven\'s sake, of course it was a death threat! What did you think was in an envelope like that, a wedding invitation?"\\n—Magistrate\'s assistant', '"Oh, how I love gold. I\'d eat and breathe it if I could."\\n—Leland, tax collector', '"One last push, and then my task is done."', '"Our people are torn by infighting. Until the two sides reconcile, our laws can carry no meaning."', '"Rage is not the answer. Rage followed by fitting vengeance is the answer."\\n—Ajani Goldmane', '"Rats and jackals feast in his swath, but even they will not walk with him."\\n—Mangara', '"Realms emerge and wither like autumn leaves, but the World Tree endures eternally."\\n—Esika, god of the Tree', '"She\'s quick and fearless, and she\'s never missed a shot. That almost makes up for all the scorch marks she leaves behind."\\n—Captain Lannery Storm', '"Sleep and dream, dream and snore,\\nWhile we fae complete our chore."\\n—Fae rhyme', '"Soul, flesh, even eyes—none of these are strictly necessary for deadly precision."\\n—Modriss of Zargoth Fen', '"Speak little. Do much."', '"Spent a lifetime learning from predators. Picked up a few tricks."', '"Taking down a dragon is easy. All you need is enough space to get in a good swing."\\n—Narbulg Nine Fingers', '"The Sultai came hunting for a bear hide. Now I have a belt of naga skin, and my friend has a full belly."', '"The Tenth is under heavy attack, but it\'s being handled. I sent Mileva."\\n—Tajic', '"The dragon has no pretense of compassion, no false mask of civilization—just hunger, heat, and need."\\n—Sarkhan Vol', '"The quieter the skies, the calmer the mind."', '"The seas are vast, but the skies are even more so. Why be content with one kingdom when I can rule them both?"', '"The specimen seems to be broken."', '"The time for subtlety is over, darling."', '"There is much to learn here, but few can endure the ringing of the spires."\\n—Nulakam the Archivist', '"There\'s a hole in your plan."\\n—Noyan Dar, Tazeem lullmage', '"These benighted worlds are thick with ignorance. I will educate them. They will listen, or they will die."', '"They\'re herbivores, not prey animals. Go startle one if you want to know the difference."\\n—Huatli', '"This is a new world and a new war. We need warriors who know chaos and how to combat it."\\n—Lisha of the Azure', '"Those without beauty are Lorwyn\'s greatest tumor. The winnowers have an unpleasant duty, but a necessary one."\\n—Eidren, perfect of Lys Alana', '"Time and space are just new battlefields to be mastered."', '"To death all must go, and so in death lies ultimate power."\\n—Geth, Lord of the Vault', '"To survive exceptional times we must adapt by exceptional means."\\n—Vannifar', '"Today\'s the last day you\'ll fear sewer crocs, Garg. From now on, the sewer crocs will fear you."', '"Toralf struck the ground with his hammer, and the force of a thousand storms tore through the demonic horde."\\n—Birgi, god of storytelling', '"Try, if you must."', '"Unskin these impure bodies, Great Yawgmoth, that the flesh may welcome your blessings."\\n—*Phyrexian Scriptures*', '"Vanya Falkenrath\'s paintings are astonishing. How does she manage to achieve such rich crimson hues?"\\n—Stefan, art critic', '"We in the Conclave have a saying: \'When you hold a shield, lend your shield.\' The strong must never forget what they owe to the weak."\\n— Niszka, Selesnya evangel', '"We in the Conclave have a saying: \'When you hold a shield, lend your shield.\' The strong must never forget what they owe to the weak."\\n—Niszka, Selesnya evangel', '"Welcome to the Legion. You saved a district—now let\'s go save the world."', '"What we call magic is nothing more than hope crystallized into a destination."\\n—Perisophia the philosopher', '"What will be has always been."\\n—Wall inscription', '"What, these old things? They were just lying around, gathering dust. I figured I might as well put them to use."', '"Why do they say you shouldn\'t play with fire? Fire is the best thing to play with!"', '"Why limit yourself to mortal law when you can outlive those who enforce it?"\\n—Czaric, Orzhov prelate', '"Yes, Boros tactics are unparalleled. But when your comrades are dying around you, inner strength must carry the day."\\n—Gideon Jura, to Aurelia', '"You have to admit, Gideon—he has great form."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Your bravery honors us all."\\n—Dromoka, translated from Draconic', '"Your creations are effective, Sheoldred, but we must unite the flesh, not merely flay it."\\n—Elesh Norn, Grand Cenobite', '"Your life serves a higher purpose now: ensuring the continuation of my own."', '"Your presence at the palace this evening is required."\\n—Letter from Queen Marchesa', '"Your service shall be rewarded."\\n—Queen Lian', 'A curse is just another name for an unwanted blessing.', 'A power vacuum for the Azorius. A keepsake for Vraska.', "Alara's burning blood cannot be contained by mere earth and stone.", 'All crave the Blessed Sleep. Few receive it.', 'All suns must set.', 'All who listen hear their own song, a unique melody played just for them.', 'Amidst the darkest ashes grow the strongest seeds.', 'An elder in one pride, of the Sigiled caste in another.', 'As the green sun crowned, Phyrexian prophecies glowed on the Tree of Tales.', 'At the end of the show, she stands alone on a stage brilliant with blood.', 'Bant is a world where death and chaos hold no sway.', 'Beauty is a seed, waiting to blossom under her capable hands.', 'Blessed by the lands of winter.', 'Built on the very ground where the Ten signed the Guildpact, the tower is a monument to the past and a reminder of who holds power in the present.', 'By the law of church and crown, vampires feed only on the blood of the guilty—those declared heretics, rebels, or enemies of war.', 'Cinders carry an ancestral grudge that makes them slow to trust and quick to retaliate.', 'Cloudy with a chance of chaos.', 'Confused but undeterred, the butterflies charged into battle.', 'Cries of anguish quickly spurred cries of action.', 'Deep in Glen Elendra blossoms Oona, queen of the faeries, nourished by secrets and pollinated by stolen dreams.', 'Do not fear the lightning. Fear the one it obeys.', "Don't dig up the past if you're not prepared for the consequences.", "Dromoka's followers forsake blood ties so that they may join a greater family.", 'Dusk follows the light.', 'Eight legs carrying endless phobias.', "Elspeth's squires do not seek advancement. For them, no knightly glory could surpass the glory of serving their champion.", 'Emrakul does not grant wishes. Desires simply align to her will.', 'Enthusiasm is no match for preparation.', 'Even dragons fear its silken strands.', "Every predator is something else's prey.", 'Eyes are unnecessary for seeing the future.', 'For the Gruul, bone-crushing rage is the first priority. Accuracy comes in a distant ninetieth.', 'From death she grows living grandeur.', 'From the veins of a peasant to the sketchbook of a master.', 'Goblins can carry their body weight in loot.', 'Gold buys death. Death earns gold.', 'Hatred outlives the hateful.', 'Having flesh is increasingly a liability on Mirrodin.', 'Havoc is a small price to pay for data.', "Hazoret's disappointment at initiates who fail their final trials can manifest in terrible ways.", 'He bids his minions rise from their graves to their knees.', 'He gasped in wonder even as his body crumbled away.', 'He had glimpsed the truth of the Multiverse. Now if only he could remember it.', 'He has "friends" in places both high and low, and all seem to owe him favors.', 'He lurks in the undercity, eager for the corpse haulers to unload their rotting cargo.', "He speaks directly into his supplicants' minds using fiery words that inflame their thoughts and incite their passions.", 'He spent his life searching for the *Locked Tome of Eremil*. In the end, his mind held together just long enough to decipher a single word.', "He vowed he would never rest until he reached his destination. He doesn't know how right he was.", 'Heads and shoulders above the rest.', 'Her centuries-long search is ended.', 'Her resentment vanished as strange, unknown lands opened up before her.', 'Her wings are the prayers of the devoted; her sword, the despair of the vile.', 'His marvels of artifice pale in comparison to the developing machinery of his mind.', 'His name means "he who paints the earth red."', 'Honor the gods of Theros, and they will return the favor.', 'Hunters lure the stripling boar into the open, hoping to trap greater prey.', "If you want to wreak havoc above, sometimes it's best to look below.", 'Immolation is the sincerest form of flattery.', "In Lorwyn's brief evenings, the sun pauses at the horizon long enough for a certain species of violet to bloom with the fragrance of mischief.", "In their hunger for the arch's power, mages often forget that it only makes dragons easier to summon. It doesn't make them easier to control.", 'It pairs a long neck with a short temper.', 'It strides through the whitecover, mists in which even gargantuans can hide.', 'It tears the flesh from your bones and then swallows the ash with its fiery maw.', 'Its wings disturb more than air.', 'Jund feasts on the unprepared.', "Leonos had no second thoughts about the abolishment edict. He'd left skyrunes warning of the eviction, even though it was cloudy.", "Life's circle has become inverted in Grixis. The same energy is endlessly recycled and becomes more stagnant with each pass.", 'Light streaked down from the heavens, and a voice whispered in the soldier\'s ear: "You shall not fall today."', 'Lord Windgrace dedicated his life to restoring Urborg to its former glory.', "Magic is the true artist's medium.", 'Many sigils, one purpose.', 'Members of the Simic Combine adapt themselves to suit whatever role they feel drawn to.', 'Memories burn with the brightest flames.', 'Nature grows solutions to its problems.', 'No matter how deep you bury it, some evil refuses to stay dead.', 'Not all storms come from the sky.', 'Not even the most scathing critics can break her concentration.', "Offerings must first be freed from the prison of their own skin before they're welcomed into the Flesh Singularity.", 'Ojutai sought to rewrite history. Those who disagreed sought the truth elsewhere.', 'Olka collected the evening mist for years, studying its secrets. Once she learned its essence, she could vanish with a thought.', "Once a fierce foe, she would become one of Madara's greatest protectors.", 'One offering to appease her on her arrival. Another to celebrate her departure.', 'One quiet word sets off the stampede.', 'Phyrexians spent countless hours unsuccessfully trying to harvest and recreate blinkmoth serum.', "Ral's storm crackled with mystical detections: Planeswalkers were infiltrating Ravnica.", "Scions of the Markov line take particular pleasure in the perversion of humans' holy rituals.", 'She awoke with blood on her brow, an axe in her hand, and heads at her feet.', 'She paints pictures with words, though not all pictures show the truth.', 'She remembers all those who would otherwise be forgotten.', "She remembers every word spoken, from the hero's oath to the baby's cry.", 'Silumgar never passes up an opportunity to add to his opulence.', 'Snaking remnants of nature directed by a body of thought and progress, the oracles embody all that is Simic.', 'Sometimes gestures of support are small. Sometimes not.', 'Sorin had created Avacyn, so it was a cruelty beyond imagining, a pain beyond description, that it fell upon him to end her forever.', 'Spilled blood always begets more of the same.', 'The Arbiter is a conduit of justice, a will so disciplined that it dispenses justice without ego or remorse.', "The Boros banner stands tall even if its bearer doesn't.", 'The Phyrexian death machine awoke, its coldsteel heart imbuing it with sinister new power.', 'The angels appreciated the offer but politely declined to eat any birdseed.', "The boar leads its rider to victory in battle, but it doesn't know how close it is to becoming the victory feast.", 'The calligraphy of combat is written with strokes of sudden blood.', "The city mourned Niv-Mizzet's death, but he left behind the components for his rebirth.", 'The fastest way across the dunes is above.', 'The fatal flaw in every plan is the assumption that you know more than your enemy.', 'The fearful want the procedure before a blood festival. The guilty seek it afterward.', 'The fine print is illegible scribbles, but it *is* legally binding.', 'The forlorn cries of the dead combine to make its laugh.', "The ideas came flooding in so fast that they couldn't all be contained.", "The lawmage served her a warrant as long as Niv Mizzet's tail. She thanked him, then used it as kindling to burn down his house.", 'The model incorporated the fifth sun effortlessly, as if it had always known.', 'The most successful of Simic creations is cytoplasm, a living, symbiotic substance that feeds off genetic rhythms and strengthens its host in return.', 'The nacatl called this new species "vetli," their word for poison arrows.', 'The naga of the Sultai Brood made deals with dark forces to keep their power.', 'The peaks of Hurloon never fall silent.', 'The progeny of the Maelstrom shows no allegiance—and no mercy—to any of the five shards.', "The sparkmage shrieked, calling on the rage of the storms of his youth. To his surprise, the sky responded with a fierce energy he'd never thought to see again.", 'The thoughtweft is his informant, and he its devoted guardian.', 'The ultimate answer to intrigue and subtlety.', 'The vast network of predation on Jund has actually caused some strange creatures to adapt to being eaten.', 'The wolf closed in. But then a strange wind whispered through the leaves, and with a burst of speed, the deer surged forward out of reach.', 'Their bodies rotted, their bones splintered, and their souls frayed to tatters. Only then were they granted the mercy of death.', "There's no better defense than simply being out of reach.", 'Those who displease Oona soon learn the extent of the armies she commands.', 'Those who regard the Gruul as savage simpletons underestimate the subtle power of their shamans.', 'Those without a guild signet often display a different form of protection.', 'To be Arbiter is to dispense few words and many judgments.', 'To walk its streets is to burn in its beauty.', 'Trust is the only bridle a pegasus will accept.', 'Two taken, two judged, one returned.', 'Unhappy with the creation of the wolfir, Rorica broke with her order and led a crusade against the "reformed werewolves."', 'Viashino thrashes keep iguanars as hunting companions, giving them wounded captives as playthings.', 'Visiting a shrine at the start of a journey makes the traveler more likely to finish it.', "When the rebels couldn't breach the castle to kill Lalor the Obstinate, they tried a more internal approach to depose the pretender king.", 'Where Razia was aloof and untouchable, Aurelia is on the frontlines, calling for war.', 'Winners of the Iroan Games are forever remembered as heroes of their people.', 'With clarity of vision comes clarity of function.', 'Wracked and warped with anguish, it obsessively seeks out other souls to hoard within its eternal prison.', "Yargle hadn't bargained on her showing up.", 'You will scream out your innermost secrets just to make it stop.', "Zur remained aloof from Terisiare's suffering, intent only on his own perfection."]
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Rex', 'Alayna Danner', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Antonio José Manzanedo', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Caio Monteiro', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chase Stone', 'Chippy', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Christina Davis', 'Christine Choi', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Chuck Lukacs', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Cole Eastburn', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Daarken', 'Dallas Williams', 'Dan Frazier', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Dana Knutson', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Dany Orizio', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Allsop', 'David Gaillet', "David O'Connor", 'David Rapoza', 'Dermot Power', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Dimitar Marinski', 'Donato Giancola', 'Douglas Shuler', 'Drew Tucker', 'Ekaterina Burmak', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Eric Fortune', 'Eric Velhagen', 'Erica Yang', 'Ernanda Souza', 'Evan Shipard', 'Filip Burburan', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'G-host Lee', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Howard Lyon', 'Ian Miller', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jake Murray', 'Jakub Kasper', 'Jama Jurabaev', 'James Paick', 'James Ryman', 'Jana Schirmer & Johannes Voss', 'Jarreau Wimberly', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jeff Miracola', 'Jehan Choo', 'Jeremy Enecio', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Jim Nelson', 'Joe Slucher', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'John Stanko', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Josh Hass', 'Josu Hernaiz', 'Julie Dillon', 'Jung Park', 'Justin Sweet', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Keith Garletts', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Kimonas Theodossiou', 'Kirsten Zirngibl', 'LA Draws', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lie Setiawan', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Mark Behm', 'Mark Hyzer', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Romanoski', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Winters', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Milivoj Ćeran', 'Nicholas Gregory', 'Nils